      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "most of cheaters don't really steal your avatar - they just want to show off that they can do it. So they don't care about such \"protection\" as 90% of them will only switch to your avatar in front of you and go to other map only do this same. (on create new account if banned) Only very small percentage of people will really steal avatar and use it after that - and then they will just spend some time on it and remove that element, either by unity or by code.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
